# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# ── Secrets ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Every env file stays local (.env, .env.local, .env.*.local, …).
# Only the documented template is committed.
.env*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
keystore/

# ── Dependencies ─────────────────────────────────────────────
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# ── Next.js / build output ───────────────────────────────────
/.next/
/out/
/build
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# ── Testing ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
/coverage

# ── Foundry (contracts/) ─────────────────────────────────────
# Build output and local deployment logs. Sources, tests, scripts and the
# vendored forge-std library in contracts/lib are committed.
/contracts/out/
/contracts/cache/
/contracts/broadcast/

# ── Supabase CLI local state ─────────────────────────────────
/supabase/.temp/
/supabase/.branches/

# ── Logs ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# ── Hosting ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vercel

# ── OS / editor / local tooling ──────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.claude/
